<title>USA: BI to repurchase $2.5 mln of common stock.</title>
<headline>BI to repurchase $2.5 mln of common stock.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BI Inc said its board authorized the repurchase of as much as $2.5 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>In October 1995, the company acquired 136,373 shares of its common stock at $7.12 a share using cash reserves.</p>
<p>BI is a supplier of electronic monitoring equipment and jail management systems to corrections agencies worldwide. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
